@startuml
actor Lecturer
boundary AddStudentEmailPage
control AuthController
control StudentService
control EmailService
database Database

Lecturer -> AddStudentEmailPage: Enter student email and details
Lecturer -> AddStudentEmailPage: Click "Add Student" button
AddStudentEmailPage -> AuthController: POST /api/addStudent
AuthController -> StudentService: Validate email format and details
StudentService -> Database: Check for existing student records
Database --> StudentService: Return existing records
StudentService -> StudentService: Validate data
alt Data is valid
    StudentService -> StudentService: Generate auto-generated password
    StudentService -> Database: Save student account with email, matric number, and password
    Database --> StudentService: Return save status
    alt Account creation succeeded
        StudentService -> EmailService: Create email content
        EmailService -> StudentEmail: Send email with password and instructions
        StudentEmail --> EmailService: Return email status
        EmailService --> StudentService: Return email status
    else Account creation failed
        StudentService -> AddStudentEmailPage: Display error message
    end
else Data is invalid
    AddStudentEmailPage -> Lecturer: Display error message
end

AddStudentEmailPage -> Lecturer: Display addition status
@enduml
